          "string": [
            {
              "name": "content",
              "value": "## Financial Report for {{ $json[\"userName\"] }}\n\n**Period:** {{ $json[\"startDate\"] }} to {{ $json[\"endDate\"] }}\n\n### Summary\n- **Total Expenses:** IDR {{ $json[\"totalExpenses\"].toLocaleString()}}\n- **Total Income:** IDR {{ $json[\"totalIncome\"].toLocaleString()}}\n- **Net Amount:** IDR {{ $json[\"netAmount\"]}}.toLocaleString()}}\n- **Transaction Count:** {{ $json[\"transactionCount\"] }}\n\n### Category Breakdown\n{{ $json[\"categoryBreakdown\"]}}.map(c => `- ${c.name}: IDR ${c.total.toLocaleString()}`).join(\"\n\")}}\n\n### Insights\n1. Your highest spending category is {{ $json[\"categoryBreakdown\"][0]?.name || \"N/A\" }}.\n2. You have {{ $json[\"transactionCount\"] }} transactions in this period.\n\n---\n*Generated by Financial SaaS Platform*"
            },
            {
              "name": "reportId",
              "value": "={{ $json[\"reportId\"] }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
